                                    8 Kasım 2026
 18:31 
                                </span>
								<br />
				</div>
				<a href="https://news.google.com/publications/CAAqMAgKIipDQklTR1FnTWFoVUtFMkZ1WVdSdmJIVm5ZWHBsZEdWemFTNWpiMjBvQUFQAQ?hl=tr&gl=TR&ceid=TR%3Atr" target="_blank" class="breadcrumbs">ABONE OL:<img src="https://www.anadolugazetesi.com/resimler/google-news.png" alt="google news abone ol butonu" height="20"></a>
